# ShellCheck configuration for the flac-health-reencode repo.
#
# The test cases source their shared harness via a runtime variable:
#     . "$TESTS_ROOT/helpers.sh"
# ShellCheck cannot resolve that path from the variable alone, so point it at
# the tests directory explicitly (equivalent to passing --source-path=tests).
# Without this, every case emits SC1091 "Not following: ./helpers.sh".
source-path=tests
source-path=.